        <mxCell id="o3p" value="On-canvas annotation: &quot;Complicated (managing overhead) and Secure, performant&quot;&#10;Microsoft HLS: &quot;the options on the right are ... more instances, more management problems&quot;&#10;Doubles the instance count to ~80 and doubles the quota problem." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=9;fontColor=#605E5C;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
